# Extensionless forms of every clean URL.
#
# Both Netlify and Cloudflare Pages will usually do this on their own from the
# directory structure. These rules are written out anyway, because §9 names a
# published version returning 404 as the most serious operational failure this
# site can have, and `ordoia.com/oal/v1.0` is printed on the face of every
# scorecard ever issued. That address resolving is not something to leave to a
# host's default behaviour, or to survive a host migration by luck.

/oal/v1.0       /oal/v1.0/        301
/oal            /oal/             301
/scorecard      /scorecard/       301
/services       /services/        301
/independence   /independence/    301
/about          /about/           301
/changelog      /changelog/       301

# Terms and Privacy are deliberately not built (§10, §12.1). They are not
# redirected anywhere either: a redirect to the home page would be a link that
# resolves to the wrong thing, which is worse than one that resolves to nothing.
# They will exist when the entity does.
